      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "religion_age_claim",
      "label": "Religion Age Claim",
      "description": "The claim that 'islam is 1400 years old' is a factual statement based on historical knowledge. Islam was founded in the 7th century CE, making it approximately 1400 years old. This factual background is necessary to understand the meme's premise, which uses this age as a point of comparison to modern terrorism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
